    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune into this mindfulness simulator driven  by audio &amp; minimal mechanics to unwind and recharge in a calming environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>** Headphones highly recommended **</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NARRATIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Linda who, after being laid off, seeks peace hiking through the  emotionally transformative Appalachian Trail, inspired by her Granny's illustrative journal of the same trail from the 1980s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bluegrass is an experiential episodic  interactive audio narrative through the soundscape of Appalachia.  In a linear adventure to Mt. Katahdin, tune your ears into the relaxing audio cues. Allow yourself to be guided by Linda's inner Conscience as you keep the heart pace steady by regulating her breathwork. Influence Linda's behavior via feedback at critical moments in this interactive theatrical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unveil Granny's<strong>\u00a0hand-drawn</strong> <strong>art collectibles</strong> as you realize the episodic goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose difficulty level\u00a0</strong>based on how intense you'd like the breathwork goal to get in each episode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive <strong>spatial soundscape</strong> - teleport to the countryside among the Appalachian woods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 episodes of imagination</strong> extravaganza!\u00a0Play entirely with your ears while offering rest to the eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal mechanics</strong> - mostly spacebar and arrow keys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steady-paced</strong>, aimed at relaxation and mindfulness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comforting countryside\u00a0<strong>Bluegrass</strong> <strong>instrumental music</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719130/extras/367f4942fd195f383dac7b5aa139eeff.poster.avif?t=1751694822\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719130/extras/367f4942fd195f383dac7b5aa139eeff.webm?t=1751694822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719130/extras/367f4942fd195f383dac7b5aa139eeff.mp4?t=1751694822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
