and arrow keys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steady-paced</strong>, aimed at relaxation and mindfulness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comforting countryside\u00a0<strong>Bluegrass</strong> <strong>instrumental music</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719130/extras/367f4942fd195f383dac7b5aa139eeff.poster.avif?t=1751694822\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719130/extras/367f4942fd195f383dac7b5aa139eeff.webm?t=1751694822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719130/extras/367f4942fd195f383dac7b5aa139eeff.mp4?t=1751694822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "An audio adventure RPG. Laid off, Linda seeks peace on the Appalachian Trail. Manage her pulse with QTE-rhythm mechanics, unveil her Granny's scenic collectibles from 1980s, &amp; record your episodic zen time. Are you ready for this relaxing aural journey to Mt. Kathadin?",
